tack helicopters, and fuel reserves on the runway.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Trench &amp; Armor Elimination:</strong> Dive straight into open tank hatches and eliminate dug-in artillery positions along the front line.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3902740/extras/88a6df6ec64ee0b5f5d8b3c6f1bb58a9.poster.avif?t=1789139857\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3902740/extras/88a6df6ec64ee0b5f5d8b3c6f1bb58a9.webm?t=1789139857\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3902740/extras/88a6df6ec64ee0b5f5d8b3c6f1bb58a9.mp4?t=1789139857\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3902740/extras/29455dcc40424cf08c4a6dfeb2189e36.poster.avif?t=1789139857\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3902740/extras/29455dcc40424cf08c4a6dfeb2189e36.webm?t=1789139857\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3902740/extras/29455dcc40424cf08c4a6dfeb2189e36.mp4?t=1789139857\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Flight Dynamics &amp; Custom Payloads</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Authentic FPV Physics:</strong> Master realistic rates, aggressive throttle control, and acrobatic maneuvers tuned for high-speed runs.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Specialized Fleet:</strong> Deploy nimble interceptors to chase fast movers, or heavy-lift drones built for massive warheads.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Tailored Ordnance:</strong> Mount HEAT shaped charges for train hulls and tanks, fragmentation warheads for light vehicles and boats, or thermobarics for confined indoor spaces.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3902740/extras/05ea042754ae476a49daa7f745fa9337.poster.avif?t=1789139857\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3902740/extras/05ea042754ae476a49daa7f745fa9337.webm?t=1789139857\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3902740/extras/05ea042754ae476a49daa7f745fa9337.mp4?t=1789139857\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Zero Room for Error</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bypass electronic warfare bubbles, thread tight obstacles, and commit to the terminal dive. In modern drone warfare, you only get one chance to strike.</p>",
